# Logs
logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-single
dist-ssr
*.local

# Local environment / secrets (never commit)
.env
.env.*

# Private local dev notes / runbook (never committed — carry between machines by hand)
/DEV_LOCAL.md
*.local.md
/.dev-local/

# Generated proof/report artifacts (regenerate with `npm run test:personalization`)
scripts/.artifacts

# Throwaway review-lens / debugging probe scripts (prefixed with _; never committed)
scripts/_*.mjs

# Internal competitive-analysis / roadmap notes — leak-free but not for the public repo
/docs/competitive-analysis.md

# Editor / agent tool directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
# Ignore local agent state under .opencode/, but DO ship the project's own hnlens-* skills
# (referenced by AGENTS.md, and leak-free like AGENTS.md + review/). `.opencode/*` (not
# `.opencode/`) is required so the skills/ subdir can be re-included.
.opencode/*
!.opencode/skills/
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
